      "title": "Secrets — the person handles the value, the agent handles everything else",
      "description": "Adding, rotating and revoking the credentials the harness's automation needs, one mechanism at a time, with the exact GitHub UI path for each step. Every step that touches a value is a person's; an agent drafts the steps, checks names and expiry dates, and records what was done. Leads with the GitHub App on a personal account, the recommended mechanism (owner ruling D1=A).",
